                                "sense_id": "cd87cfdd-0dc6-3b11-87fe-b0b1d381e3d4",
                                "text": "Please allow unimpeded access to the fire escape."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd5c4df9-76ad-45c4-83cc-db583f6e1322",
                                "sense_id": "cd87cfdd-0dc6-3b11-87fe-b0b1d381e3d4",
                                "text": "As the final whistle sounded, hordes of Russian fans ran unimpeded, and seemingly without any serious police presence or any barrier to stop them, towards England supporters gathered in their section of the stand."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
